msgid "Export the cart or an order"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:331
msgid "Export is available in the cart and on the details page of each previous order."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:333
msgid "Choose columns"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:333
msgid "SKU, barcode, title, quantity, price, total and notes are available."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:334
msgid "Choose warehouse format"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:334
msgid "Use one product row with allocation in notes, or separate rows for each warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:335
msgid "Download the file"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:335
msgid "Choose CSV or XLSX. Export does not change or clear the cart."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:340
msgid "Save the cart as a draft"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:340
msgid "Enter an optional title in the cart and press “Save as draft”. The draft will appear in “My orders”."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:341
msgid "Important:"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:341
msgid "After a successful save, the current cart is cleared. A draft does not reserve stock."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:342
msgid "Open my orders"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:346
msgid "Repeat a draft or a previous order"
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:346
msgid "For a draft, press “To cart”. For a previous order, open its details and press “Load draft into cart”."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:347
msgid "Protect the current cart."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:347
msgid "Loading a draft or previous order first clears the current cart and then adds products from the selected order. Save or export the current cart first if you need it."
msgstr ""

#: pc-wholesale-help.php:348
msgid "Deleted or unavailable products may be skipped. Prices, availability and warehouse allocation are recalculated. For selected items without clearing the cart, repeat products from a Folio invoice instead."
msgstr ""

